settle 8
act tab:notes
act notes:all
settle 8
assert snap tab == Notes
assert snap note-count == 1
click role:button More actions for note at 0:01
settle 3
capture 01_private_note_menu
click role:button Make shareable: note at 0:01
settle 8
click role:button More actions for note at 0:01
settle 3
capture 02_shareable_note_menu
click role:button Export note clip at 0:01
settle 12
assert snap notice ~ Exported to
capture 03_selected_voice_exported
log Selected voice body exported through the visible note-row control
